  "guidance_scope": "Verified p8 claude-challenges or p6 claude-retry worker-visible preflight hashes are expected. Host hashes are recorded separately, not substituted for native worker guidance.",
  "claude_cli_preflight": "2.1.325 (Claude Code)",
