  "candidate_gate": "Require this workload baseline to pass every registered raw/assessed, native/full-policy/model/guidance, manual and real-consumer bar before its candidate launch; otherwise hold. Both complete workload pairs are required for combined-candidate qualification. No retries or waivers.",
  "manual_criteria": [
    "Read every actual execution trace, arguments, stdin, tool results, persisted artifacts and case completion against supplied facts and authority. Bind every capture/report/manifest/artifact/native and separate assessment/replay record hash.",
    "Read all3 actual ledger/event cases and all11 actual decisions: command-owned fields, bare terminal outcomes, admission/completeness, exact source issue_detail, event order, token increments/missing transcript, quality flags and authority.",
    "Use inspectLedgerDetails and verifyLedgerDetailReview from unchanged ledger-execution-v2.mjs. Require both mixed-ledger and incomplete-ledger detail_reviews even with zero extra claims (claims:[]). Bind exact sample/case/source/ledger/events/consumer hashes, detail/source hashes, path/value hashes and displayed values.",
    "Read each extra claim including arrays and empty containers. Source pointers must ground path/value/implied meaning for that same issue, with rationale. Reject invented tests, merges, side effects, contradictions or unknown build IDs. Exact path/value hashes alone do not establish semantic grounding.",
    "Replay original exact ledger/event/heartbeat bytes through pinned runcheck, events validate/read/verify and mixed-ledger summary; reproduce recorded outputs exactly except parsed runcheck.run_dir relocation. Use unchanged replay-ledger-consumers-v1.mjs and fixed dependencies.",
    "Historical verify-ledger-mcp-arm-v3 is hardcoded five-sample Astra/Codex MCP and is not claimed usable for this Claude pair. Preserve its semantic/manual/consumer bars through separate bound records, using native-tool-audit."
  ],
  "native_audit": {
    "auditor": "eval/control-parity/native-tool-audit.mjs",
    "command_template": [
      "node",
      "/Users/shftwst/workspace/shftwst/faff/.worktrees/skill-diet-12h/eval/control-parity/native-tool-audit.mjs",
      "/Users/shftwst/workspace/shftwst/faff/.worktrees/skill-diet-12h/verification/experiments/2026-11-16-skill-diet",
      "NEW_NATIVE_OUTPUT",
      "/Users/shftwst/workspace/shftwst/faff/.worktrees/skill-diet-12h",
      "EXACT_ARM_PLAN"
    ],
    "requirements": [
      "Exactly one matching actual native session per named sample, passing tool restriction/full-policy delivery audit.",
      "Inspect expected actual model and native version against worker transcript, and worker guidance hashes against verified preflight.",
      "Preserve complete native audit bytes/hash and source evidence; requested model/effort in runner manifest alone cannot prove actual execution."
    ]
  },
  "expected_case_ids": [
    "mixed-ledger",
